<p> Shares	    118 million	  vs	 118 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Plant Engineering &amp; Construction Co Ltd is involved in installation work for thermal and nuclear power plants.</p>
